<title>SINGAPORE: FELS buys offshore accomodation platform.</title>
<headline>FELS buys offshore accomodation platform.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Levingston Shipbuilding Ltd (FELS) said on Friday it has bought a semi-submersible offshore accomodation platform for more than US$40 million.</p>
<p>It said it had bought it for conversion into a deep water drilling rig.</p>
<p>It said the present market for deep water drilling semi-submersible rigs is strong but supply is limited. The unit it just acquired can be converted to meet this demand, said FELS.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
